      "amount": "1/2 cup"
    },
    {
      "name": "mozzarella cheese",
      "amount": "1 cup",
      "notes": "shredded"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh basil",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Slice the Italian bread buns in half and place on a baking sheet.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the bread and toast in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "In a large skillet, saute the onion, bell pepper, and mushrooms over medium heat until tender.",
    "Add the tomato sauce to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Spoon the stir-fry mixture over the toasted bread halves.",
    "Top each bread half with shredded mozzarella cheese.",
    "Return the bread to the oven and bake until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove from the oven and sprinkle with chopped fresh basil.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
  ],
